sysspectogram (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Control Center (Tauri 2 + Svelte): dashboards 1h..30d, live values,
    incidents with reports, scenarios, settings with diff and rollback,
    localhost lab runs, bilingual EN/RU.
  * sysspectogram-helper: root-side gate with polkit per action, signed
    bundle install (minisign + sha256), settings overlay.
  * Incident engine: alert correlation, ATT&CK mapping, HTML/Markdown reports.
  * Fusion gating (host threshold OR fused risk), agent score half-life,
    event-matrix features and event spectrogram CNN (opt-in).
  * Read-only VMI cross-view (mock backend; libvmi backend behind config).
  * Timeseries store with rollups for dashboards.

